WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:56.060 --> 00:01:58.930
Someone once said...

00:01:59.390 --> 00:02:02.460
If you want ginger ale, use a 
special mineral form of ginger,

00:02:02.460 --> 00:02:05.030
which brings out refreshingness 
and deep taste,

00:02:05.030 --> 00:02:08.600
while preserving the drink's freshness

00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:12.570
and sparkling carbonation for ten years...

00:02:12.570 --> 00:02:16.010
Gingercrystal!

00:02:26.720 --> 00:02:31.420
And there are apple pies made out 
of juicy, deeply sweet apples,

00:02:31.420 --> 00:02:33.390
wrapped in their crunchy peels,

00:02:33.390 --> 00:02:35.830
that fall from the sky like shooting stars...

00:02:35.830 --> 00:02:40.300
Apple Pie Meteorites!

00:02:41.170 --> 00:02:45.170
The world is in the Gourmet Age!

00:02:45.170 --> 00:02:51.080
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:56.880
Toriko and the rest continued 
their trek on Ice Mountain.

00:02:56.880 --> 00:03:01.850
Match and Takimaru were there 
to capture the Century Soup.

00:03:02.960 --> 00:03:06.630
Match is doing it for the children 
who are waiting in his hometown.

00:03:06.960 --> 00:03:10.860
If your stomach's empty, it's only 
natural to eat your fill, right?

00:03:10.860 --> 00:03:13.370
First off, eat up.

00:03:13.370 --> 00:03:16.300
Good guys, bad guys... That comes later.

00:03:16.770 --> 00:03:20.940
Takimaru is doing it to buy medicine 
in Life, the country of healing.

00:03:20.940 --> 00:03:23.140
I will get them, for sure!

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:26.480
No matter how much money 
it takes... Without fail...

00:03:27.750 --> 00:03:31.580
Aimaru-san... Please wait 
for just a little longer.

00:03:33.450 --> 00:03:36.490
Toriko encourages everyone 
and cheers them up.

00:03:36.890 --> 00:03:40.990
All of us are gonna get 
the Century Soup, you bet!

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:47.000
And after a lost baby Wall Penguin 
took a liking to Komatsu,

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:49.330
he started taking care of it.

00:03:50.030 --> 00:03:53.400
Why, you little... What do 
you think you're doin'...

00:03:55.370 --> 00:03:58.410
Meanwhile, after Mansom called in Coco,

00:03:58.410 --> 00:04:01.880
he took off for the soup hunt to find Toriko.

00:04:02.280 --> 00:04:09.520
Meanwhile, in a hidden cavern, Tina 
and Zonge ran into a frozen Hellboros.

00:04:10.290 --> 00:04:12.760
It's the Last Boss!

00:04:16.990 --> 00:04:20.460
They also encountered a mystery 
man who removed his mask

00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:23.370
and buffeted them with incessant chatter.

00:04:23.370 --> 00:04:25.000
Anyway, I'm not good with words.

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:29.140
Sometimes I'm careless and my mouth 
just overruns with dirty jokes...

00:04:29.140 --> 00:04:32.310
Maybe it's really best not to talk so much...

00:04:32.310 --> 00:04:34.310
He can't keep his clap shut!

00:04:34.640 --> 00:04:36.410
So, people...

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:38.110
Why the silent treatment?

00:04:38.110 --> 00:04:41.150
Why, you! Who the heck are you?

00:04:42.620 --> 00:04:44.350
He clammed up!

00:04:46.120 --> 00:04:49.630
And Toriko's group is under 
attack from Insect Beasts.

00:04:50.630 --> 00:04:54.360
Tommyrod and his colleagues are closing in...

00:04:54.360 --> 00:04:56.360
I've found you...

00:05:01.170 --> 00:05:05.970
Glorious Bug Tamer! Tommyrod vs Toriko!

00:05:13.920 --> 00:05:15.120
They're fast!

00:05:20.120 --> 00:05:21.060
Knife!

00:05:29.560 --> 00:05:31.470
One blow won't hit 'em!

00:05:31.670 --> 00:05:35.470
This will decrease my power and speed...

00:05:36.600 --> 00:05:39.440
...but here I go! Rapid-fire!

00:05:39.440 --> 00:05:41.270
Flying Fork!

00:05:43.640 --> 00:05:44.950
Knife!

00:05:52.450 --> 00:05:54.590
7-fold...

00:05:54.590 --> 00:05:55.620
...Spiked Punch!

00:05:59.660 --> 00:06:01.930
Everyone, be careful!

00:06:01.930 --> 00:06:05.160
These insects are trying 
to crawl into our bodies!

00:06:07.970 --> 00:06:09.140
Ice Gun!

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:12.470
Shin!

00:06:12.470 --> 00:06:13.510
Match-san!

00:06:13.510 --> 00:06:16.080
Its shell is as hard as armor...

00:06:16.710 --> 00:06:18.040
I'll aim for the joints!

00:06:30.890 --> 00:06:32.320
Relaxation...

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:36.160
Single Perforating Plunge!

00:06:39.730 --> 00:06:42.530
Spinning Beetle Split!

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:46.470
Y-You did it!

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:48.710
It's not dead yet! Don't let down your guard!

00:06:52.240 --> 00:06:53.240
What?!

00:06:56.450 --> 00:06:57.420
Knife!

00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:04.760
Jeez... Sucker just doesn't want to die...

00:07:04.760 --> 00:07:07.860
I'm surprised that there are 
insects in this frozen land.

00:07:08.530 --> 00:07:11.460
I suppose they're a type that's 
adapted to sub-zero temperatures.

00:07:11.460 --> 00:07:15.170
Unless someone has brought them here...

00:07:21.200 --> 00:07:24.840
H-Hey, you're gonna be all right!

00:07:24.840 --> 00:07:27.980
So don't cry, okay?

00:07:27.980 --> 00:07:31.380
I really wanna return it to its parents,

00:07:31.380 --> 00:07:33.880
but in these circumstances, 
that's a tall order.

00:07:33.880 --> 00:07:38.650
And if an adult Wall Penguin showed 
up, we'd be in even deeper trouble.

00:07:38.920 --> 00:07:43.030
They're ferocious beasts. 
They'd go on a rampage.

00:07:43.890 --> 00:07:45.930
Come on, you're gonna be fine.

00:08:20.960 --> 00:08:22.200
What the...?!

00:08:22.200 --> 00:08:24.170
Something is coming again...

00:08:50.220 --> 00:08:53.560
They're here! The Gourmet Corp.!

00:09:01.030 --> 00:09:03.200
What are we gonna do now?!

00:09:03.200 --> 00:09:06.040
Th-This kind of thing happens a lot.

00:09:06.270 --> 00:09:09.810
You think it's the Last Boss, but 
it's an unexpected development.

00:09:09.810 --> 00:09:12.280
The adventure isn't over yet!

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:13.380
What will you do, Zonge?!

00:09:13.380 --> 00:09:14.680
Fight, Zonge!

00:09:14.680 --> 00:09:17.650
Until the day you defeat the Last Boss!

00:09:18.050 --> 00:09:19.620
Wise words from a veteran!

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:22.920
You sure have gotten through 
many scenes of carnage, right?!

00:09:22.920 --> 00:09:26.060
All this way and they're 
still going on about RPGs...

00:09:26.060 --> 00:09:28.260
Enough with the stupidity!

00:09:28.260 --> 00:09:31.260
Whoever says "stupid" first is stupid!

00:09:31.700 --> 00:09:32.430
Say...

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:33.000
Hey!

00:09:32.430 --> 00:09:33.900
Let's follow that guy from before.

00:09:33.900 --> 00:09:36.240
He seemed to know a lot about the soup.

00:09:36.240 --> 00:09:37.800
He may know the location, too!

00:09:38.670 --> 00:09:42.110
I mean, that's what I was thinking already!

00:09:42.110 --> 00:09:44.340
Your mind moves so quickly!

00:09:44.340 --> 00:09:47.910
Yeah, yeah. You can say anything after 
someone else says it first, right?

00:09:47.910 --> 00:09:50.020
All right! Let's hurry!

00:10:01.230 --> 00:10:04.100
Hmm... Strange.

00:10:04.100 --> 00:10:07.230
I thought I'd be able to 
see the aurora by now...

00:10:08.800 --> 00:10:11.040
And the effect of the methane hydrate

00:10:11.240 --> 00:10:14.370
should be melting the Gourmet Show Window...

00:10:14.370 --> 00:10:17.610
Maybe Master's fears are 
proving to be true...

00:10:17.610 --> 00:10:20.780
But if that is the case, 
it lowers the tension.

00:10:20.780 --> 00:10:23.510
Still, if I don't do it, 
Master's gonna yell at me.

00:10:23.510 --> 00:10:25.780
That's the one thing I wanna avoid.

00:10:25.780 --> 00:10:27.150
But still...

00:10:28.120 --> 00:10:30.350
I'm talking too much...

00:10:32.220 --> 00:10:33.520
Down there...?

00:10:33.520 --> 00:10:35.490
The location of the Century Soup...

00:10:46.540 --> 00:10:49.410
W-What's this?!

00:10:55.810 --> 00:10:58.080
G-Gourmet Corp.!

00:10:58.080 --> 00:11:00.480
Them, Toriko-san?!

00:11:01.250 --> 00:11:03.790
Brace yourselves, everyone.

00:11:04.650 --> 00:11:07.160
This is the hard part.

00:11:08.860 --> 00:11:10.890
Landing!

00:11:10.890 --> 00:11:14.260
Nice to meet you!

00:11:14.260 --> 00:11:16.830
So you're Toriko?!

00:11:18.530 --> 00:11:20.540
Goodbye.

00:11:26.210 --> 00:11:27.310
Toriko-san!

00:11:27.310 --> 00:11:28.740
Toriko-san!

00:11:29.140 --> 00:11:30.250
What?

00:11:30.980 --> 00:11:32.710
I appreciate this.

00:11:32.980 --> 00:11:36.450
I didn't think you'd get in 
this close to me right away.

00:11:36.450 --> 00:11:38.290
But it's welcome.

00:11:38.290 --> 00:11:40.460
I can't... get my arm out!

00:11:41.120 --> 00:11:46.460
In close quarters combat, it's easier 
for me to give a how-do-you-do.

00:11:46.460 --> 00:11:48.000
10-fold...

00:11:48.000 --> 00:11:49.200
...Spike Pun...

00:12:07.210 --> 00:12:12.790
Wall Penguin (Avian Beast) Capture Level 30

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:14.520
W-What?!

00:12:19.660 --> 00:12:21.430
The Wall Penguin parents, eh?

00:12:21.660 --> 00:12:24.100
They've come looking for their child!

00:12:24.560 --> 00:12:26.070
What the hell are those?!

00:12:26.070 --> 00:12:29.000
They think we've kidnapped 
their baby penguin!

00:12:29.500 --> 00:12:31.470
Th-Th-That isn't what happened!

00:12:31.470 --> 00:12:34.610
Wall Penguin father and mother!

00:13:59.620 --> 00:14:01.460
Kiss, hurry!

00:14:03.260 --> 00:14:05.760
It doesn't bode well that the 
Gourmet Corp. got ahead of me...

00:14:06.060 --> 00:14:10.230
If they get the soup, they'll make 
their move on the Gourmet World.

00:14:10.630 --> 00:14:13.340
And if that happens, even GOD will be stolen!

00:14:13.700 --> 00:14:19.280
Still, according to my divinations, 
the Century Soup is already...

00:14:20.140 --> 00:14:22.440
Although I hope I'm wrong...

00:14:59.380 --> 00:15:03.350
There... There it is!

00:15:03.950 --> 00:15:05.990
I found it!

00:15:07.050 --> 00:15:10.420
The Gourmet Show Window!

00:15:18.030 --> 00:15:20.070
I-It's so beautiful...

00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:24.910
This is the legendary Gourmet Show Window!

00:15:29.310 --> 00:15:33.580
Then the Century Soup is gathered below us.

00:15:34.480 --> 00:15:36.580
T-Toriko-san!

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:37.580
Your hand!

00:15:38.520 --> 00:15:42.490
Komatsu... You go get the soup!

00:15:43.960 --> 00:15:47.460
One glance at this awe-inspiring 
Gourmet Show Window...

00:15:48.130 --> 00:15:51.830
...and I can tell that 
the ingredients are lean!

00:15:55.230 --> 00:15:59.740
The scent is weak, and above all, 
you can't see the aurora one bit!

00:16:00.610 --> 00:16:03.740
There's a possibility that 
there's not much broth left.

00:16:04.480 --> 00:16:06.910
I'm thinking there's only 
a little bit of soup left.

00:16:07.480 --> 00:16:09.180
And you have to get it first!

00:16:09.180 --> 00:16:10.250
Toriko-san...

00:16:12.080 --> 00:16:15.690
I'll keep these bastards in check!

00:16:16.120 --> 00:16:19.120
The soup is below us, isn't it?

00:16:19.320 --> 00:16:20.890
Go, Komatsu!

00:16:20.890 --> 00:16:22.090
R-Right!

00:16:22.090 --> 00:16:25.160
Bogie, Barry, get rid of him.

00:16:25.160 --> 00:16:25.860
Right!

00:16:25.860 --> 00:16:26.660
Crap!

00:16:27.800 --> 00:16:29.630
I think I can get down from there!

00:16:29.630 --> 00:16:30.640
Okay!

00:16:31.000 --> 00:16:32.000
Whoops!

00:16:39.280 --> 00:16:41.050
Takimaru! Match!

00:16:41.280 --> 00:16:42.280
Huh?

00:16:42.680 --> 00:16:44.250
What do you scum want?

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:47.350
I don't have a beef with you...

00:16:47.750 --> 00:16:52.020
But unfortunately, we're after the soup, too.

00:16:52.020 --> 00:16:54.190
Takimaru-san! Match-san!

00:16:54.630 --> 00:16:56.860
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:16:56.860 --> 00:17:03.600
If you're going to hoard all the 
soup, I'll take it from you next.

00:17:03.600 --> 00:17:06.200
I'm not gonna hoard it!

00:17:06.200 --> 00:17:09.240
I'll make sure there's enough for all of us!

00:17:09.240 --> 00:17:12.110
Including the children of Nerg!

00:17:14.640 --> 00:17:15.980
Komatsu!

00:17:15.980 --> 00:17:16.280
Yes?!

00:17:22.450 --> 00:17:23.790
I'm counting on you!

00:17:24.150 --> 00:17:26.960
T-Toriko-san...

00:17:28.620 --> 00:17:30.790
Right! Leave it to me!

00:17:36.670 --> 00:17:38.100
That little...

00:17:38.100 --> 00:17:41.440
It's okay. Let him go.

00:17:41.440 --> 00:17:42.470
But...

00:17:42.470 --> 00:17:45.070
Either way, we're going to wipe them all out.

00:17:45.370 --> 00:17:47.840
Who cares about the order?

00:17:48.140 --> 00:17:52.750
Besides, I'm going to send out some hunters.

00:17:59.090 --> 00:18:03.360
I see. A Bug Tamer...

00:18:05.890 --> 00:18:10.730
That's right. Cute, aren't they?

00:18:10.730 --> 00:18:13.370
What's your name?

00:18:13.370 --> 00:18:19.070
I'm Tommyrod, a Vice-Chef 
of the Gourmet Corp.

00:18:19.070 --> 00:18:23.480
Unusual for you people not to use a GT Robot.

00:18:23.480 --> 00:18:27.610
Or did you use them all up 
at the Regal Mammoth hunt?

00:18:28.080 --> 00:18:30.980
I heard retrieving them was a failure.

00:18:31.720 --> 00:18:34.520
We've got a GT Robot here!

00:18:34.520 --> 00:18:35.590
What?!

00:18:35.590 --> 00:18:39.030
But I wonder where it is now...

00:18:40.390 --> 00:18:44.500
Although I have no use for it...

00:18:44.500 --> 00:18:48.200
But more to the point, Toriko...

00:18:51.440 --> 00:18:55.940
Can I kill you right about now?

00:18:58.780 --> 00:19:01.680
When I fought Starjun, he had a GT Robot...

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:06.650
Grinpatch was mostly just playing around.

00:19:07.590 --> 00:19:12.460
My first real fight with a 
Vice-Chef face to face...

00:19:13.230 --> 00:19:18.460
Takimaru and Match's opponents... I 
bet those guys are higher ranks, too.

00:19:18.460 --> 00:19:20.970
The Gourmet Corp.'s culinary heads...

00:19:23.800 --> 00:19:27.270
Don't look anywhere but at me, Toriko!

00:19:27.270 --> 00:19:30.440
Let's hurry up and play!

00:19:30.440 --> 00:19:33.240
I can't use my right hand...

00:19:33.710 --> 00:19:36.410
I don't know what he did to me...

00:19:36.750 --> 00:19:39.850
...but having this handicap while 
going up against a Vice-Chef...

00:19:40.220 --> 00:19:44.120
...I'd better prepare myself for the worst!

00:19:47.190 --> 00:19:49.860
Takimaru! Match!

00:19:51.030 --> 00:19:52.230
Toriko-san!

00:19:52.230 --> 00:19:55.530
I'm leaving those two to you!

00:20:05.540 --> 00:20:09.680
Don't drag me down, Takimaru boy.

00:20:09.680 --> 00:20:13.180
Just make sure you don't 
get in my way, old man.

00:20:13.380 --> 00:20:14.480
All right...

00:20:14.820 --> 00:20:16.220
You wanna go for it?

00:20:48.380 --> 00:20:52.590
I'm grumble-grumble hungry! 
My tummy's rumble rumblin'!

00:20:53.690 --> 00:20:56.860
Today we're out there: Ack 
SOS, I'm in trouble yes!

00:20:56.860 --> 00:21:00.230
Gotta go! Gotta go! Can't 
leave this alone, right?

00:21:00.500 --> 00:21:03.700
Giving you support and cheer, 
the duties are endless!

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:07.070
Burnin' up! Bustin' out! Trouble buster!

00:21:07.070 --> 00:21:10.110
Oh my god! A heaping helping of energy!

00:21:10.110 --> 00:21:13.910
When I'm hungry I can't get any power!

00:21:13.910 --> 00:21:17.450
Go, fight! At attention to you!

00:21:17.450 --> 00:21:20.620
Two-way communication!

00:21:20.620 --> 00:21:24.120
The encouragement I get 
from you is my nourishment!

00:21:24.390 --> 00:21:27.860
I want to eat lots of delicious things!

00:21:27.860 --> 00:21:31.230
Our future looks to be tasty!

00:21:31.230 --> 00:21:33.090
Right? OK. Left? OK.

00:21:33.090 --> 00:21:37.800
Be careful, courageously! Right on, let's go!

00:21:37.800 --> 00:21:41.370
Fight with bravery!

00:21:41.370 --> 00:21:45.070
Deli-deli delicious, and let's eat!

00:21:49.810 --> 00:21:51.710
Gourmet News!

00:21:52.350 --> 00:21:54.110
I'm your host, Tina!

00:21:54.710 --> 00:21:58.790
The Jungle Stag Beetle has 
scissor-like claws like a crab.

00:21:59.450 --> 00:22:03.360
This insect apparently 
just loves premium melon.

00:22:03.360 --> 00:22:09.660
And today I'll teach you a method to 
easily enjoy the taste of melon at home. {not just buying a melon? oh, that's right, they're 5,000 yen...}

00:22:10.300 --> 00:22:16.300
When you pour honey on top of 
cucumbers, it tastes like melon!

00:22:24.380 --> 00:22:26.210
That's a heaping helping of deliciousness!

00:22:26.210 --> 00:22:27.850
Melon!

00:22:27.850 --> 00:22:32.180
And if you want to get a 
little more creative...

00:22:32.180 --> 00:22:36.020
Wrap ham around your 
honey-covered cucumbers...

00:22:42.730 --> 00:22:45.060
It tastes like prosciutto and melon!

00:22:45.060 --> 00:22:46.930
That's the icing on the cake!

00:22:46.930 --> 00:22:50.000
It tastes so delicious, I 
think I'll give it a name:

00:22:50.000 --> 00:22:51.370
Honeycu! {pun on honeydew?}

00:22:54.740 --> 00:22:55.740
Brr...

00:22:56.410 --> 00:23:00.510
At a time like this, you'll be 
fine if you wear a Lighter Suit!

00:23:00.510 --> 00:23:02.180
I'm warm!

00:23:02.180 --> 00:23:04.620
Now, on to the next story!

00:23:06.850 --> 00:23:10.110
Takimaru is at the mercy of Bogie Woods' dangerous physique!

00:23:10.110 --> 00:23:13.020
Listen to the sound of your heart, and use your Pre-Shot Routine!

00:23:13.520 --> 00:23:16.730
Gratitude and Pride! Takimaru's Full-Out Corkscrew Shot!

00:23:17.210 --> 00:23:18.930
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
